{"sections":[{"slug":"Azumaya范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Azumaya范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Azumaya <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"subject":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/范畴论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴论</span>"}}]},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Azumaya 范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Azumaya <span lang=\"zh\">范畴是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Azumaya代数","text":"Azumaya <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的推广</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">参考</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/BorceuxVitaleAzumayaCategory","text":"Borceux–Vitale"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal V$ <span lang=\"zh\">为余完备</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/闭范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">闭</span>"}},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $\\mathcal I$ <span lang=\"zh\">为仅有一个对象</span> $*$ <span lang=\"zh\">且满足</span> $\\operatorname{Hom}(*,*)=1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $\\mathcal V$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $\\mathcal V$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $A$, <span lang=\"zh\">如下条件等价</span>:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">存在</span> $\\mathcal V$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal B$, <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $A\\otimes\\mathcal B$ "},{"Local":{"url":"/Morita等价","text":"Morita <span lang=\"zh\">等价</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">于</span> $\\mathcal I$.</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal A\\otimes\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{op}}$ "},{"Local":{"url":"/Morita等价","text":"Morita <span lang=\"zh\">等价</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">于</span> $\\mathcal I$.</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为中心可分</span> $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且典范函子</span> $\\mathcal A\\otimes\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to\\mathcal V$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathcal A\\otimes\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{op}}$-<span lang=\"zh\">模中的强生成元</span>.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">典范函子</span> $\\mathcal A\\otimes\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to\\mathcal V$ "},{"Local":{"url":"/全忠实函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">全忠实</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">且作为</span> $(\\mathcal A\\otimes\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal I)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴上的模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">双模</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">为小投射强生成元</span>.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">注</span></strong>. "},{"Local":{"url":"/Azumaya代数","text":"Azumaya <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是上述概念</span> $\\mathcal V = \\mathsf{Mod}(R)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的特殊情形</span>.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴上的模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴上的模</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">页面解释了上述定义中涉及的概念</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这些概念都是环上的模与代数的类似概念的推广</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}